WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.368 --> 00:00:03.569
-A dangerous hurricane is
heading toward the U.S.

00:00:03.569 --> 00:00:05.338
and the president
has been saying

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:06.939
some very dumb stuff about it.

00:00:06.939 --> 00:00:09.142
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:10.710
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:13.846 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:13.846 --> 00:00:16.182
Donald Trump's
first and only goal

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:18.752
has always been enriching
and protecting himself.

00:00:18.752 --> 00:00:20.052
In fact, you might remember

00:00:20.052 --> 00:00:21.888
that during
his Congressional testimony,

00:00:21.888 --> 00:00:24.223
Trump's ex-fixer Michael Cohen
recounted

00:00:24.223 --> 00:00:26.025
that Trump's presidential bid

00:00:26.025 --> 00:00:29.495
began solely as a way
to advertise his personal brand

00:00:29.495 --> 00:00:30.830
and make money, calling it

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:33.233
the greatest infomercial
in political history.

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:35.601
And one of the very specific
promises Trump made

00:00:35.601 --> 00:00:37.604
in his year-and-a-half-long
infomercial

00:00:37.604 --> 00:00:39.639
was that he was the only
candidate

00:00:39.639 --> 00:00:41.040
who could protect Americans,

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:43.876
like the time he aired an ad
that ended with the slogan,

00:00:43.876 --> 00:00:47.547
"Donald Trump will protect you.
He is the only one who can."

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:50.717
Which is not only wrong,
but incredibly creepy.

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:53.719
It sounds like something that
would be scribbled on a note

00:00:53.719 --> 00:00:58.090
slipped under the door by
a stalker in a Lifetime movie.

00:00:58.090 --> 00:01:00.893
You expect to hear that
after your estranged husband

00:01:00.893 --> 00:01:02.862
appears on the balcony
in a thunderstorm.

00:01:02.862 --> 00:01:06.732
"Donald! You startled me."

00:01:06.732 --> 00:01:08.200
[ As Trump ]
I'll protect you, Cynthia.

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:10.302
I'm the only one who can.

00:01:10.302 --> 00:01:13.005
[ Thunder crashes ]

00:01:13.005 --> 00:01:16.209
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:16.209 --> 00:01:19.679
[ Normal voice ] So, if you saw
the Trump infomercial

00:01:19.679 --> 00:01:21.314
and you bought the product,

00:01:21.314 --> 00:01:22.982
that's what he claimed
you were getting --

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:24.884
A president who would
protect you from danger,

00:01:24.884 --> 00:01:28.154
and if you order now, two free
travel-sized containers.

00:01:28.154 --> 00:01:29.489
[ Audience groans, laughter ]

00:01:29.489 --> 00:01:31.290
But now it's clear
as it's ever been

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:33.927
that much like any other product
you buy from an infomercial,

00:01:33.927 --> 00:01:35.894
it was a lot [bleep]
than it looked on TV.

00:01:35.894 --> 00:01:37.797
For example, Trump was asked
this weekend about

00:01:37.797 --> 00:01:40.299
a rebel faction in the country
of Colombia

00:01:40.299 --> 00:01:44.003
known by its Spanish acronym,
FARC, whose former leader

00:01:44.003 --> 00:01:46.973
has called for a return to
violence after a peace deal.

00:01:46.973 --> 00:01:49.008
This is obviously
a major foreign policy issue

00:01:49.008 --> 00:01:50.109
that any president should have

00:01:50.109 --> 00:01:52.045
at least a basic knowledge
about.

00:01:52.045 --> 00:01:53.579
And yet, when Trump was asked
about it,

00:01:53.579 --> 00:01:55.181
he barely seemed to even know

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:56.849
what the reporter
was talking about.

00:01:56.849 --> 00:02:01.321
-About Colombia, how do you feel
about former FARC leaders

00:02:01.321 --> 00:02:03.756
calling for a return to war?

00:02:03.756 --> 00:02:05.658
-Colombia, you said?

00:02:05.658 --> 00:02:08.194
-Yeah, Colombia.
Former leaders of FARC.

00:02:08.194 --> 00:02:11.231
-You're talking about
the country of Colombia?

00:02:11.231 --> 00:02:14.067
Yeah. No,
we have a great relationship,

00:02:14.067 --> 00:02:16.402
and they're not doing badly.

00:02:16.402 --> 00:02:18.170
They have a problem
because of Venezuela.

00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:21.641
A lot of people are pouring in,
but Colombia,

00:02:21.641 --> 00:02:23.676
we've had a great relationship
with Colombia.

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:27.579
-Good Lord. It's like when
the dumbest kid in your class

00:02:27.579 --> 00:02:30.850
is giving an oral report
and stalling for the bell,

00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:34.220
but he's so dumb,
he forgot class just started.

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:35.621
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.621 --> 00:02:41.527
[ As Trump ] Colombia, you say?
Yeah, sure, here we go.

00:02:41.527 --> 00:02:44.630
Buckle up, everybody, because
here comes an oral report

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:47.166
about Colombia.

00:02:47.166 --> 00:02:51.303
Which is a country...
that is our friend.

00:02:51.303 --> 00:02:54.474
Come on, ring, bell, ring!

00:02:54.474 --> 00:02:58.177
[ Normal voice ]
"Donald, it's 9:01."

00:02:58.177 --> 00:02:59.378
Also, what do you mean,

00:02:59.378 --> 00:03:00.813
"You're talking about
the country of Colombia"?

00:03:00.813 --> 00:03:02.248
What else could
he be talking about?

00:03:02.248 --> 00:03:05.050
Did you think he was talking
about Columbia Pictures?

00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:07.720
[ As Trump ] We have a great
relationship with Columbia.

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:11.190
In fact, we're right now
in the process of obtaining

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:15.595
a VHS copy of
"The Shawshank Redemption."

00:03:15.595 --> 00:03:17.263
[ Normal voice ] Of course,
Trump probably thinks FARC

00:03:17.263 --> 00:03:19.165
is just how they say
"fork" in Boston.

00:03:19.165 --> 00:03:21.534
[ Boston accent ] Honey,
we don't need new silverware.

00:03:21.534 --> 00:03:23.970
I'll just go to Dunkies
and steal some plastic farcs."

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:26.105
[ Laughter ]

00:03:26.105 --> 00:03:29.075
So Trump maybe doesn't know

00:03:29.075 --> 00:03:31.444
there's a country called
Colombia,

00:03:31.444 --> 00:03:33.212
and then there's Trump's
ignorance

00:03:33.212 --> 00:03:34.546
when it comes to
Hurricane Dorian,

00:03:34.546 --> 00:03:36.815
a category 2 hurricane
currently approaching the U.S.

00:03:36.815 --> 00:03:39.585
Trump apparently knows
just as much about hurricanes

00:03:39.585 --> 00:03:41.887
as he does about Colombia
because when it was

00:03:41.887 --> 00:03:44.157
first classified
as a category 5 hurricane,

00:03:44.157 --> 00:03:47.594
Trump went out of his way to say
he had no idea what that was.

00:03:47.594 --> 00:03:50.930
-Dorian is the fourth category 5
hurricane to threaten the U.S.

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:52.765
since President Trump
took office.

00:03:52.765 --> 00:03:55.934
But the president said at
a FEMA briefing yesterday,

00:03:55.934 --> 00:03:58.237
he's never heard
of such a thing.

00:03:58.237 --> 00:04:00.739
-I'm not sure that I've ever
even heard of a category 5.

00:04:00.739 --> 00:04:04.877
I knew it existed,
and I've seen some category 4s.

00:04:04.877 --> 00:04:06.178
You don't even see them
that much.

00:04:06.178 --> 00:04:09.615
But a category 5 is something
that I don't know

00:04:09.615 --> 00:04:11.183
that I've ever even
heard the term

00:04:11.183 --> 00:04:13.419
other than I know it's there.

00:04:13.419 --> 00:04:16.189
[ Laughter ]

00:04:16.189 --> 00:04:18.858
-What do you mean you've never
heard of a category 5 hurricane?

00:04:18.858 --> 00:04:20.993
You've already had three of them
as president.

00:04:20.993 --> 00:04:23.763
You've definitely heard of them,
you just forgot.

00:04:23.763 --> 00:04:27.099
Is that why you're wearing a hat
that says "USA"

00:04:27.099 --> 00:04:30.736
to remind you of which country
you're in?

00:04:30.736 --> 00:04:35.541
[ As Trump ] God bless the...

00:04:35.541 --> 00:04:37.043
"Ooosa."

00:04:37.043 --> 00:04:38.377
[ Laughter ]

00:04:38.377 --> 00:04:39.879
[ Normal voice ]
Also, that's not...

00:04:39.879 --> 00:04:44.617
[ Applause ]

00:04:44.617 --> 00:04:47.553
That's not what anyone
wants to hear from the president

00:04:47.553 --> 00:04:49.555
when a hurricane
is bearing down on them.

00:04:49.555 --> 00:04:52.525
It's like if you called 911
and the operator said

00:04:52.525 --> 00:04:54.894
[Bleep]

00:04:54.894 --> 00:04:58.131
"104-degree fever? I didn't know
they went that high!

00:04:58.131 --> 00:04:59.966
[ Laughter ]

00:04:59.966 --> 00:05:04.570
Gary! Gary!

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:08.307
Did you know it went to 104?!

00:05:08.307 --> 00:05:11.443
Gary knew."

00:05:11.443 --> 00:05:14.079
But the weirdest thing about
this is it's not even

00:05:14.079 --> 00:05:16.082
the first time Trump has used
this line.

00:05:16.082 --> 00:05:17.516
In fact,
he has repeatedly claimed

00:05:17.516 --> 00:05:20.419
throughout his presidency
that he's never heard

00:05:20.419 --> 00:05:22.555
of a category 5 hurricane
before.

00:05:22.555 --> 00:05:24.724
-They've never seen a category
like this come in

00:05:24.724 --> 00:05:26.292
'cause it came in really at a 5.

00:05:26.292 --> 00:05:28.227
It was a category 5.

00:05:28.227 --> 00:05:30.929
I never even knew
a category 5 existed.

00:05:30.929 --> 00:05:33.299
This has been a category 5

00:05:33.299 --> 00:05:35.267
which few people have
ever even heard of.

00:05:35.267 --> 00:05:36.802
A category 5.

00:05:36.802 --> 00:05:39.271
Nobody's ever heard
of a 5 hitting land.

00:05:39.271 --> 00:05:44.376
Category 5 hurricane.
Category 5.

00:05:44.376 --> 00:05:47.080
Never heard about
category 5s before.

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:50.015
Got hit as a 5, category 5 storm

00:05:50.015 --> 00:05:52.451
which just literally
never happens.

00:05:52.451 --> 00:05:56.055
So we've never seen it actually
touch down as a category 5.

00:05:56.055 --> 00:05:58.858
People have never seen
anything like that.

00:05:58.858 --> 00:06:02.095
-The best part of that montage
are that the faces of the people

00:06:02.095 --> 00:06:03.662
around him are definitely saying

00:06:03.662 --> 00:06:06.432
they have heard
of a category 5 before.

00:06:06.432 --> 00:06:09.801
Look at that. That is the face
of a guy thinking,

00:06:09.801 --> 00:06:15.241
"Yeah, I can count to 5."

00:06:15.241 --> 00:06:17.910
Trump is incapable of
and uninterested in

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:20.112
delivering on the basic duties
of his office.

00:06:20.112 --> 00:06:21.914
In fact, he often makes
the situation worse

00:06:21.914 --> 00:06:24.216
like when he tweeted on Sunday
in addition to Florida,

00:06:24.216 --> 00:06:26.652
South Carolina, North Carolina,
Georgia, and Alabama,

00:06:26.652 --> 00:06:29.522
were most likely be hit
(much) harder than anticipated,

00:06:29.522 --> 00:06:31.791
looking like one of the largest
hurricanes ever.

00:06:31.791 --> 00:06:35.327
"Already category 5. Be careful.
God bless everyone."

00:06:35.327 --> 00:06:40.132
Okay. First of all, why is the
word "much" in parentheses

00:06:40.132 --> 00:06:41.867
like it's a secret?

00:06:41.867 --> 00:06:44.871
[ As Trump ] They'll be hit
harder -- "Much" harder.

00:06:44.871 --> 00:06:46.038
[ Laughter ]

00:06:46.038 --> 00:06:47.940
[ Normal voice ]
Second, and most importantly,

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:49.575
Trump was wrong,
because 20 minutes later,

00:06:49.575 --> 00:06:52.077
the National Weather Service had
to issue a clarification saying,

00:06:52.077 --> 00:06:55.014
and this is real, "Alabama will
not see any impacts from Dorian.

00:06:55.014 --> 00:06:57.416
We repeat, no impacts
from Hurricane Dorian

00:06:57.416 --> 00:06:58.885
will be felt across Alabama.

00:06:58.885 --> 00:07:00.853
The system will remain
too far east."

00:07:00.853 --> 00:07:02.154
The President
of the United States

00:07:02.154 --> 00:07:04.389
said an entire state
was in danger from a hurricane

00:07:04.389 --> 00:07:06.425
when it wasn't and the
government had to correct him.

00:07:06.425 --> 00:07:08.794
I hope we never see another
wildfire ever again,

00:07:08.794 --> 00:07:10.863
but if you do, can you imagine
the Trump tweet?

00:07:10.863 --> 00:07:12.998
"Wildfires spreading quickly
from California

00:07:12.998 --> 00:07:14.500
to New Jersey to Spain.

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:16.135
Everyone in Barcelona,
be careful,

00:07:16.135 --> 00:07:18.037
and God (Dios) bless you."

00:07:18.037 --> 00:07:19.338
[ Laughter ]

00:07:19.338 --> 00:07:21.574
Seriously, what?

00:07:21.574 --> 00:07:25.778
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:25.778 --> 00:07:28.147
What other corrections
is the government going to

00:07:28.147 --> 00:07:31.650
have to put out as Trump's brain
continues to deteriorate?

00:07:31.650 --> 00:07:34.386
We're like a week away from
the Justice Department tweeting,

00:07:34.386 --> 00:07:35.888
"Contrary
to the president's tweet,

00:07:35.888 --> 00:07:38.023
the Joker is not a threat.

00:07:38.023 --> 00:07:40.459
He's a character in a movie
played by Joaquin Phoenix.

00:07:40.459 --> 00:07:42.728
There is no evacuation
of Gotham under way,

00:07:42.728 --> 00:07:44.597
nor is Gotham a real place."

00:07:44.597 --> 00:07:46.165
[ Laughter ]

00:07:46.165 --> 00:07:47.799
Trump inaccurately spreading
disinformation

00:07:47.799 --> 00:07:49.869
about a dangerous hurricane
headed toward the U.S.,

00:07:49.869 --> 00:07:51.436
despite the fact
that he made a big show

00:07:51.436 --> 00:07:52.971
of staying in Washington
to monitor the storm

00:07:52.971 --> 00:07:54.340
and even skipped a trip abroad,

00:07:54.340 --> 00:07:56.175
sending Vice President
Mike Pence instead.

00:07:56.175 --> 00:07:58.477
-President Trump announcing
today that he is canceling

00:07:58.477 --> 00:08:02.181
his trip to Poland this weekend
because of Hurricane Dorian.

00:08:02.181 --> 00:08:04.783
The Poland trip was intended
to mark the 80th anniversary

00:08:04.783 --> 00:08:07.186
of the beginning
of World War II.

00:08:07.186 --> 00:08:09.187
The Vice President Mike pence
will attend

00:08:09.187 --> 00:08:11.657
in the president's place.
-Okay, let's be honest.

00:08:11.657 --> 00:08:13.860
I bet Trump didn't want to go
on this trip to begin with.

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:15.327
He was probably happy
to stay home.

00:08:15.327 --> 00:08:17.062
He hates going abroad.

00:08:17.062 --> 00:08:18.330
There's no Fox News.

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:20.599
The McDonald's there have
different menus.

00:08:20.599 --> 00:08:22.501
And he has to wear
a full suit and tie

00:08:22.501 --> 00:08:23.970
instead of whatever
this look is.

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:27.306
I guess you could call this
retiree chic.

00:08:27.306 --> 00:08:29.275
Eventually, though,
they're going to have to add

00:08:29.275 --> 00:08:30.977
a message to the top of the hat
that said,

00:08:30.977 --> 00:08:32.611
"If found, return to the..."

00:08:32.611 --> 00:08:34.880
[ Laughter ]

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:37.549
Also you know the other world
leaders were probably relieved

00:08:37.549 --> 00:08:39.151
when they heard Trump
wasn't showing up.

00:08:39.151 --> 00:08:41.654
Because when he does,
he always says something insane

00:08:41.654 --> 00:08:43.823
like at the G7 in France
last week

00:08:43.823 --> 00:08:45.691
when he was asked about
the climate crisis

00:08:45.691 --> 00:08:48.227
which, of course,
is making natural disasters

00:08:48.227 --> 00:08:50.796
like hurricanes far more
frequent and intense.

00:08:50.796 --> 00:08:52.865
And he said this insane thing.

00:08:52.865 --> 00:08:55.267
-Mr. President, there was
a significant talk at the summit

00:08:55.267 --> 00:08:56.636
about climate change.

00:08:56.636 --> 00:08:59.238
I know in the past you've
harbored some skepticism

00:08:59.238 --> 00:09:00.673
of the science
of climate change.

00:09:00.673 --> 00:09:02.375
What do you think the world
should be doing

00:09:02.375 --> 00:09:05.744
about climate change, and do you
still harbor that skepticism?

00:09:05.744 --> 00:09:11.583
-I feel that the United States
has tremendous wealth.

00:09:11.583 --> 00:09:14.052
The wealth is under its feet.

00:09:14.052 --> 00:09:17.756
I've made that wealth
come alive,

00:09:17.756 --> 00:09:19.891
and I'm not going to lose
that wealth.

00:09:19.891 --> 00:09:24.163
I'm not going to lose it
on dreams, on windmills,

00:09:24.163 --> 00:09:26.698
which, frankly,
aren't working too well.

00:09:26.698 --> 00:09:27.866
I'm not going to lose it.

00:09:27.866 --> 00:09:31.136
-No, you've definitely lost it.

00:09:31.136 --> 00:09:32.671
You're rambling about windmills

00:09:32.671 --> 00:09:37.242
and making wealth come alive
under our feet.

00:09:37.242 --> 00:09:38.978
You're like an old prospector.

00:09:38.978 --> 00:09:40.746
You should be wearing
a Stetson hat

00:09:40.746 --> 00:09:42.448
with a canteen around your neck.

00:09:42.448 --> 00:09:43.983
[ As Gabby Hayes ]
There's riches in these hills,

00:09:43.983 --> 00:09:45.417
boys, right under our feet!

00:09:45.417 --> 00:09:48.620
We just got to make it
come alive!

00:09:48.620 --> 00:09:50.623
[ Normal voice ] On top of that,
Trump also used the occasion

00:09:50.623 --> 00:09:53.526
as a way to enrich himself
by reportedly encouraging Pence

00:09:53.526 --> 00:09:56.762
to stay at Trump's private
golf resort in Ireland

00:09:56.762 --> 00:09:58.330
on Pence's way back from Poland

00:09:58.330 --> 00:10:00.499
with taxpayers once again
picking up the tab.

00:10:00.499 --> 00:10:02.501
Pence was in Ireland holding
meetings in Dublin,

00:10:02.501 --> 00:10:04.136
and yet he chose to stay
at Trump's resort,

00:10:04.136 --> 00:10:05.904
which is three-hour drive away

00:10:05.904 --> 00:10:07.173
on the other side
of the country.

00:10:07.173 --> 00:10:09.041
That's like if every night
when I did this show,

00:10:09.041 --> 00:10:10.676
instead of going back
to my apartment,

00:10:10.676 --> 00:10:13.412
I stayed at a Radisson
in Baltimore

00:10:13.412 --> 00:10:16.381
because Lorne Michaels owned it.

00:10:16.381 --> 00:10:18.016
[ As Lorne Michaels ]
It's a nice Radisson.

00:10:18.016 --> 00:10:20.385
And, you know, if you don't,
uh...

00:10:20.385 --> 00:10:22.254
If you don't want us
to wash your towels,

00:10:22.254 --> 00:10:25.257
just hang them up.

00:10:25.257 --> 00:10:30.996
[ Laughter ]

00:10:30.996 --> 00:10:32.130
[ Normal voice ]
And when he was asked today

00:10:32.130 --> 00:10:33.665
about this obviously
corrupt practice,

00:10:33.665 --> 00:10:35.701
Pence clearly did not have
a good answer.

00:10:35.701 --> 00:10:38.670
-Vice President Mike Pence
took over the boss's duties

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:42.341
overseas, sparking criticism
by going well out of his way

00:10:42.341 --> 00:10:44.476
in Ireland to stay
at a Trump resort there.

00:10:44.476 --> 00:10:45.777
-Just to give you a chance
to respond,

00:10:45.777 --> 00:10:47.713
Democrats
have criticized you today

00:10:47.713 --> 00:10:50.916
for staying at the Trump
property in Doonbeg.

00:10:50.916 --> 00:10:52.584
They say you're enriching
the president.

00:10:52.584 --> 00:10:54.686
What's your response
to that criticism?

00:10:54.686 --> 00:10:57.656
-[ Inhales deeply ]

00:10:57.656 --> 00:10:59.625
It's wonderful to be back
in Ireland.

00:10:59.625 --> 00:11:00.959
[ Laughter ]

00:11:00.959 --> 00:11:03.329
-Nothing is better than
watching the fake principal,

00:11:03.329 --> 00:11:06.364
holier-than-no-one Pence-bot
short circuit.

00:11:06.364 --> 00:11:08.267
Mr. Vice President,
as a religious man,

00:11:08.267 --> 00:11:10.035
what are your thoughts
on the president paying off

00:11:10.035 --> 00:11:12.337
an adult film star to cover up
an affair he had

00:11:12.337 --> 00:11:16.575
while being married?

00:11:16.575 --> 00:11:21.279
[ Laughter ]

00:11:21.279 --> 00:11:23.215
[ As Pence ] It's great
to be back in Ireland.

00:11:23.215 --> 00:11:25.084
[ Laughter ]

00:11:25.084 --> 00:11:27.219
[ Normal voice ]
He was so flummoxed,

00:11:27.219 --> 00:11:29.087
his brain literally froze.

00:11:29.087 --> 00:11:31.624
In fact, after that,
he just stood there on the lawn

00:11:31.624 --> 00:11:34.460
for a few hours while
technicians rewired him.

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:36.862
[ Laughter ]

00:11:36.862 --> 00:11:39.598
The president sold himself
as a strongman

00:11:39.598 --> 00:11:42.000
who was uniquely suited
to protecting Americans,

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:45.003
and he has repeatedly made clear
he's utterly incapable

00:11:45.003 --> 00:11:48.406
of even that basic task --
Both because he's incompetent

00:11:48.406 --> 00:11:51.276
and because his only interest
is enriching himself.

00:11:51.276 --> 00:11:53.278
We've had corrupt,
stupid presidents before,

00:11:53.278 --> 00:11:54.580
but Donald Trump
is at a level...

00:11:54.580 --> 00:11:56.882
-Which few people have ever
even heard of.

00:11:56.882 --> 00:11:58.751
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:11:58.751 --> 00:12:00.152
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:12:00.152 --> 00:12:01.721 line:0%
♪♪

